{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lemonade Apocalypse: The Great Filter</strong> is an incremental clicker, with branching gameplay and story. Explore 27 different gameplay combinations and endings with the story based Prestige mode!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SUPPLY &amp; DEMAND SIM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At its core is the supply and demand mechanic. Use dubious means to manipulate demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/THREE_CHAPTERS.png?t=1749490275\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/1_THE_YARD.png?t=1749490275\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ENVY THE NEIGHBOURHOOD KIDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All your friends has a bicycle, and you want one too. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/STORY_0000_3.png?t=1749490275\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HUMBLE BEGINNINGS OF GREED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After getting a bicycle you realize that this can become a business. Choose between Cheap Lemonade, Aesthetic Lemonade and Sugarfree Lemonade. Each with its unique twist on the gameplay, and affects the story! More choices in the Factory stage and End Game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/Business_idea.png?t=1749490275\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/2_FACTORY.png?t=1749490275\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MANAGE A FACTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage the lemonade production with employees - and look out for unions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/3_HQ.png?t=1749490275\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WORLD DOMINATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get involved in politics once you reach enough influence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NUMBERS GO UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's an incremental clicker. Expect to become filthy rich, and the worlds first trillionaire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/Oligarch.png?t=1749490275\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HANDDRAWN ART</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All art is drawn by hand with a unique style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story driven incremental clicker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prestige when you finish the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supply &amp; demand sim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay that evolves with your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">27 different story endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple mini-games</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3427820?t=1749490275","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/a8259d3e64c8a78cb39ef4dfa0a0c8c871274e5e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749490275","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/c56e8bd4d13f1c3a80dcd1355f7133938157ed9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749490275","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/c56e8bd4d13f1c3a80dcd1355f7133938157ed9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749490275","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors